# Environment variables — PriceScout (standalone repo `E:\Projects\pricescout`)

Copy to `.env.local` for dev; production mirrors these on the VPS / hosting provider.

```
# Postgres (required for admin/auth once migrated)
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://USER:PASSWORD@HOST:5432/pricescout_prod

# Session JWT — min 16 chars (generate random)
PS_SESSION_SECRET=

# Public site URL — used for Stripe redirects & canonical metadata
NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL=http://127.0.0.1:3300
# Vimeo walkthrough embed ID for /watch (dispatch 004)
NEXT_PUBLIC_VIMEO_WALKTHROUGH_ID=

# Stripe (live) — create products in Dashboard, paste Price IDs here (dispatch 003)
# Week Pass $29 one-time | Pro Monthly $49/mo | Pro Annual $490/yr | Founders $699 one-time | Device add-on $15/mo
STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=sk_live_xxxxx
STRIPE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=pk_live_xxxxx
STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET=whsec_xxxxx
STRIPE_PRICE_WEEK_PASS=price_xxxxx
STRIPE_PRICE_PRO_MONTHLY=price_xxxxx
STRIPE_PRICE_PRO_ANNUAL=price_xxxxx
STRIPE_PRICE_FOUNDERS_LIFETIME=price_xxxxx
STRIPE_PRICE_DEVICE_ADDON=price_xxxxx

# Tenant slug stamped into Checkout metadata / webhook reconciliation
DEFAULT_TENANT_SLUG=demo-thrift

# Optional observability (103)
SENTRY_DSN=

# Seed demo password override (optional)
SEED_DEMO_PASSWORD=demo-password!

# Comparable-sales APIs (083)
COMP_PROVIDER=auto
KEEPA_API_KEY=
EBAY_CLIENT_ID=
EBAY_CLIENT_SECRET=

# Transactional mail (operator sets on VPS)
RESEND_API_KEY=
# From address Resend accepts for your domain (e.g. PriceScout <mail@pricescout.pro>)
RESEND_FROM=

# Optional: Play Console internal testing link for admin “APK in build” tile (dispatch 008)
NEXT_PUBLIC_ANDROID_INTERNAL_PLAY_URL=

# Playwright base URL override for e2e
PLAYWRIGHT_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:3300
```
